{
  "declaredLength": 2800,
  "decoding": "confirmed-per-slot-XOR-rotate3-index-seed",
  "format": "GF Trinity encrypted UTF-16 message DAT",
  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "那人个～性这么差，\n怎么还那么强啊？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 380,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90A34EBA4E2AFF5E60278FD94E485DEEFF0C000A600E4E488FD890A34E485F3A554AFF1F00100002011400160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "虽说是属性被克，\n但我一点赢的机会都没有……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 428,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "867D8BF4662F5C5E602788AB514BFF0C000A4F4662114E0070B98D627684673A4F1A90FD6CA167092026202600100002011400160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "而且，为什么她是名流？\n还搞了个由紫特区，简直是耍～诈吧？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 484,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "800C4E14FF0C4E3A4EC04E485979662F540D6D41FF1F000A8FD8641E4E864E2A75317D2B7279533AFF0C7B8076F4662F800DFF5E8BC85427FF1F00100002011400160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "春紫。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 552,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "66257D2B300200100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "又是个～性差……又是耍～诈……\n你这些话是什么意思呢？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 568,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "53C8662F4E2AFF5E60275DEE2026202653C8662F800DFF5E8BC820262026000A4F608FD94E9B8BDD662F4EC04E48610F601D5462FF1F00100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "啊！咦？\n你把我的话听成那样了吗？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 632,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "554AFF0154A6FF1F000A4F60628A621176848BDD542C621090A368374E865417FF1F00100002011400160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "看来全息影像通讯器的状态不太好啊。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 676,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "770B67655168606F5F7150CF901A8BAF5668768472B660014E0D592A597D554A300200100002011400160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我刚才只是在自言自语地说，\n由紫的实力有五个～星，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n来由紫特区的人都喜欢被她耍～着玩。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 720,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6211521A624D53EA662F572881EA8A0081EA8BED57308BF4FF0C000A75317D2B76845B9E529B67094E944E2AFF5E661FFF0C00100001BE00000A676575317D2B7279533A76844EBA90FD559C6B2288AB5979800DFF5E774073A9300200100002011400160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 51
    },
    {
      "displayText": "原来如此。\n说到底，你都是怪全息的状态不好啊。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 824,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "539F676559826B643002000A8BF452305E95FF0C4F6090FD662F602A5168606F768472B660014E0D597D554A300200100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "没用全息影像通讯器的话，\n我听到的就是“个性差”和“耍诈”哦。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 880,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6CA175285168606F5F7150CF901A8BAF566876848BDDFF0C000A6211542C523076845C31662F201C4E2A60275DEE201D548C201C800D8BC8201D54E6300200100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "哎哟喂……那只是闷在我心里的\n真心话不小心说出来一点点而已！！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 952,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "54CE54DF55822026202690A353EA662F95F7572862115FC391CC7684000A771F5FC38BDD4E0D5C0F5FC38BF451FA67654E0070B970B9800C5DF2FF01FF0100100002011400160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "要是能打场宝可梦对战的话，\n这些想法就能嗖地一下消失了。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1024,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8981662F80FD6253573A5B9D53EF68A65BF9621876848BDDFF0C000A8FD94E9B60F36CD55C3180FD55D657304E004E0B6D8859314E86300200100002011400160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "看来有必要让你明白啊。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1092,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "770B676567095FC589818BA94F60660E767D554A300200100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那么春紫，\n我要和<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000><U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿȂ先生小姐齐心协力，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n跟你一决胜负。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 10,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1124,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90A34E4866257D2BFF0C000A62118981548C001000020100000000100003110000FF02025148751F5C0F59D09F505FC3534F529BFF0C00100001BE00000A8DDF4F604E0051B380DC8D1F300200100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000><U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿȂ先生小姐，没问题吧？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1212,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "001000020100000000100003110000FF02025148751F5C0F59D0FF0C6CA195EE98985427FF1F00100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "开始吧！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1260,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5F0059CB5427FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "请等一下！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1272,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8BF77B494E004E0BFF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "同伴是我，对手也是我！\n这是个棒上加棒的状况！<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n不打一场还等什么！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1284,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "540C4F34662F6211FF0C5BF9624B4E5F662F6211FF01000A8FD9662F4E2A68D24E0A52A068D2768472B651B5FF0100100001BE00000A4E0D62534E00573A8FD87B494EC04E48FF0100100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 41
    },
    {
      "displayText": "敌我双方都有我。\n正因为是名流，才能实现这样的对战！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1368,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "654C621153CC65B990FD670962113002000A6B6356E04E3A662F540D6D41FF0C624D80FD5B9E73B08FD9683776845BF96218FF0100100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1432,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000><U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿȂ先生小姐，\n请和全息的我对战。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1444,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "001000020100000000100003110000FF02025148751F5C0F59D0FF0C000A8BF7548C5168606F768462115BF96218300200100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "要是来场对战，说不定由紫小姐的\n记忆也会飞散到天边！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1504,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8981662F6765573A5BF96218FF0C8BF44E0D5B9A75317D2B5C0F59D07684000A8BB05FC64E5F4F1A98DE6563523059298FB9FF0100100002011400160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "来对战吧！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1568,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "67655BF962185427FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "请等一下",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1580,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8BF77B494E004E0B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你可真会吊人胃口……\n我会等你同意和我们对战的！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 1592,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F6053EF771F4F1A540A4EBA80C353E320262026000A62114F1A7B494F60540C610F548C62114EEC5BF962187684FF0100100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "有春紫在，\n就意味着胜利是属于我们的！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 1652,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "670966257D2B5728FF0C000A5C31610F5473774080DC5229662F5C5E4E8E62114EEC7684FF0100100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你就当是帮我个忙，来对战吧！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 1700,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F605C315F53662F5E2E62114E2A5FD9FF0C67655BF962185427FF0100100002011400160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "好～！集中攻击由紫小姐的话，\n说不定这一切都会被勾销掉。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 1740,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "597DFF5EFF0196C64E2D653B51FB75317D2B5C0F59D076848BDDFF0C000A8BF44E0D5B9A8FD94E00520790FD4F1A88AB52FE95006389300200100002011400160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "和<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000><U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿȂ先生小姐一队的话，\n我们就能打遍天下无敌手！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 1808,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "548C001000020100000000100003110000FF02025148751F5C0F59D04E00961F76848BDDFF0C000A62114EEC5C3180FD6253904D59294E0B65E0654C624BFF0100100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 1884,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF001D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "引导大众正是我等\n名流的职责呀，皮可西！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 1896,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5F155BFC59274F176B63662F62117B49000A540D6D417684804C8D235440FF0C76AE53EF897FFF0100100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "拿出我们的看家本领！\n超级进化，大闹一场咯，毒藻龙！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 1948,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62FF51FA62114EEC7684770B5BB6672C9886FF01000A8D857EA78FDB5316FF0C592795F94E00573A54AFFF0C6BD285FB9F99FF0100100002011400160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "全息的我也能使用超级进化，\n真是不可思议！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 2012,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5168606F768462114E5F80FD4F7F75288D857EA78FDB5316FF0C000A771F662F4E0D53EF601D8BAEFF0100100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 2064,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "这是理所当然的胜利！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 2076,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8FD9662F740662405F537136768480DC5229FF0100100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "春紫会抱怨，\n是因为她不安于现状吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 2108,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "66257D2B4F1A62B16028FF0C000A662F56E04E3A59794E0D5B894E8E73B072B65427300200100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "但我无法理解为什么\n她和我在一起，却无法感到幸福。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 2156,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F46621165E06CD5740689E34E3A4EC04E48000A5979548C621157284E008D77FF0C537465E06CD5611F52305E78798F300200100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "赢不了由紫小姐，\n似乎让我对自己的不满……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 2216,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8D624E0D4E8675317D2B5C0F59D0FF0C000A4F3C4E4E8BA962115BF981EA5DF176844E0D6EE12026202600100002011400160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "以一种奇怪的形式发泄了出来……\n我会更加奋发图强的。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 2268,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4EE54E0079CD5947602A76845F625F0F53D16CC44E8651FA676520262026000A62114F1A66F452A0594B53D156FE5F3A7684300200100002011400160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "如果是这样，\n我们就做更多更多的特训吧！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 39,
      "offsetInSection": 2332,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5982679C662F8FD96837FF0C000A62114EEC5C31505A66F4591A66F4591A768472798BAD5427FF0100100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我和全息的我都是你的对手，\n你一定能得到很多锻炼，变得更强！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 40,
      "offsetInSection": 2384,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6211548C5168606F7684621190FD662F4F6076845BF9624BFF0C000A4F604E005B9A80FD5F9752305F88591A953B70BCFF0C53D85F9766F45F3AFF0100100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000><U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿȂ先生小姐，\n感谢你帮忙，这是给你的谢礼。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 41,
      "offsetInSection": 2456,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "001000020100000000100003110000FF02025148751F5C0F59D0FF0C000A611F8C224F605E2E5FD9FF0C8FD9662F7ED94F6076848C22793C300200100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>获得了\n另一种颜色的由紫装扮连衣裙！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 42,
      "offsetInSection": 2524,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "001000020100000083B75F974E86000A53E64E0079CD989C8272768475317D2B88C5626E8FDE886388D9FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
